              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aníng iri báy, «Tam geera Mose nee Samueli i sihhitiia dír geeraaeé' as iwa firina', tam adoorihe aníng mukwí u baloó gurtlawaaká. Dir'eene amór saaw tay hiinges, diirihe ni quutliye'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Burta báy, ‹Amór ti tlawaan a amá?› Ki beer, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsaxwaaeé', gár aayor'eé' isa laqwál baraakaá yaamií ale, asma aníng a heé ta niqin, nee oo ta tlampa'aamisi baraakaá yaamu sleémeerowo. Aníng hee ugwa kiriikiiká, laqaá aníng heé iga kiriik i kaahh, hamí ala umuú heewo in lu'umis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, axáy lo'or'ín án i /ak, barnaxes aníng kuúng ugwa sagadiyuusiiká ar muunuú /awaák, nee barnaxes aníng kuúng ugwa tsuwa firiimiiká as wakuuser'eé', qoomár kiwa baramaanuusi nee iwa baraá slahh'amií dirii'iya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, heé muqsli geeqawto ga aleesláw i deéro, muqslidá' sirdaa/aat ar /iikú daahh?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
