          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng daqaari'iimarhúng nee qaasirhunge an haasaáng wa haniís dír wakuuserhúng ar aldaafi wasl, as tlakweemaahúng kudá' taa tlehhaahhité' baraá yaamuhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuungá' nu lawaalér wakuuserhúng tleéhh baraá yaamaá kuungá' ta xua'aaká, asma buhhtaeé' naa daa/atuyé' adór gil'ór asla, tidá' baloó gwa'aaká daqisleém.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.14"
            ]
          }
        }
